<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<worksheet component = "cur" xml:id = "wksht-sign-charts" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
    <title>Sign Charts for Inequalities</title>

    <introduction>
        <p>
            <ul>
                <li><title>Dates</title>
                    <p>Assigned Date: November 11, 2026</p>
                    <p>Due Date: November 18, 2026</p>
                </li>
                <li><title>Objective</title>
                    <p>
                        In this activity, completed in class on November 11, we explored using sign charts for solving polynomial and rational inequalities.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </p>
    </introduction>

<page>

<paragraphs>
    <title>In-Class Work</title>
    <p>
        These problems were completed during the in-class activity.
    </p>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                2x^2 \lt -5x + 12
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                \frac{x-4}{x+2} \geq 3
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                \frac{x^2}{x^2 + 4x - 21} \leq 0
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

</paragraphs>

<paragraphs>
    <title>Hand-in Exercises</title>
    <p>
        The following problems will need to be written up carefully and turned in to the assignment on Canvas by the due date at the top of the first page.
    </p>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                x^3 - 5x^2 \gt 50x
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                \frac{x-3}{x+2} \leq 4
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

<exercise workspace="0in">
    <statement>
        <p>
            Solve <md>
                \frac{x-1}{x+5} \gt \frac{x-7}{x+3}
            </md>.
            
        </p>
    </statement>

</exercise>

</paragraphs>
</page>
</worksheet>